{{!--
    ui/empty-state - centered "nothing here yet" placeholder for the inside of a card that
    brings its own header and primary action (the passkeys card on the account security
    page). Block form; the block is the explanatory sentence under the title:
      {{#> ui/empty-state icon="icon-[tabler--fingerprint]" title="No passkeys registered"}}
      Register this device to sign in without typing a password.
      {{/ui/empty-state}}
    ui/list-empty is the sibling for a whole list page: it wraps itself in a card and its
    copy is search/filter-aware, which is why it cannot be nested inside a card.
    NB the partial-block pitfall - a block whose content is nothing but a {{#if}} wrapper
    loses it. Hoist such a condition outside the call and use one block per arm.
    Params:
      icon  - full iconify class for the muted glyph (optional; pass the complete class so
              the Tailwind scanner sees it at the call site)
      title - bold headline (required)
      class - extra classes on the wrapper (optional)
--}}
<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 py-6 text-center{{#if class}} {{class}}{{/if}}">
    {{#if icon}}<span class="{{icon}} text-base-content/30 size-10"></span>{{/if}}
    <p class="mb-0 font-medium">{{title}}</p>
    {{#if @partial-block}}
    {{!-- own hash params neutralized against fallthrough into the block --}}
    <p class="text-base-content/60 mb-0 max-w-md text-sm">{{> @partial-block icon="" title="" class=""}}</p>
    {{/if}}
</div>
